      "id": "2121811724999299121",
      "text": "FINAL: Heat 137, Pistons 117. Couldn’t slow down Giannis (34-14-8) or Klay (26 points, 6-11 from 3). Couldn’t shoot, making 11-of-34 3-pointers (32%). Fall to 8-4 overall. Cunningham: 33 points, 8 assists, 5 rebounds Huerter: 20 points, 7 assists, 3 blocks",
      "url": "https://x.com/omarisankofa/status/2121811724999299121",
      "published": "2026-11-15T03:45:11+00:00",
      "likes": 8,
