    {
      "id": "2121802664963186860",
      "text": "End of 3: Heat 103, Pistons 86. Outscored 66-47 in the 2nd and 3rd quarters. Shooting 38% overall and 10-30 (33%) from 3. Hasn’t been their night. Cunningham: 21 pts, 8 assts Huerter: 18 pts Robinson: 10 pts",
