    {
      "id": "2121791199891578898",
      "text": "Going into the half. ‣ Kevin Huerter: 16 PTS • 7-10 FG ‣ Cade Cunningham: 16 PTS • 6 AST ‣ Duncan Robinson: 10 PTS https://t.co/jdd04meZnF",
