    {
      "id": "2121791001882943567",
      "text": "Halftime: Heat 68, Pistons 60. Outscored 31-21 in the 2nd while shooting just 7-28 overall and 1-10 from 3. Missed a lot of open ones. Only four 2nd chance points with 12 offensive rebounds. Not capitalizing on their opportunities. Cunningham: 16 pts, 6 assts Huerter: 16 pts",
      "url": "https://x.com/omarisankofa/status/2121791001882943567",
      "published": "2026-11-15T02:22:50+00:00",
      "likes": 8,
      "author": "Omari Sankofa II",
      "handle": "omarisankofa",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1716521350007865346/ugW0SByW_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2121787955178246551",
      "text": "Huerter is playing very good basketball. 13 points, 6-8. He really does everything pretty well",
      "url": "https://x.com/omarisankofa/status/2121787955178246551",
      "published": "2026-11-15T02:10:44+00:00",
      "likes": 27,
      "author": "Omari Sankofa II",
      "handle": "omarisankofa",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1716521350007865346/ugW0SByW_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2121786625055166525",
      "text": "Offense has leaks that can only be plugged by Duren. Pistons are just surviving at center",
      "url": "https://x.com/omarisankofa/status/2121786625055166525",
      "published": "2026-11-15T02:05:26+00:00",
      "likes": 167,
      "author": "Omari Sankofa II",
      "handle": "omarisankofa",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1716521350007865346/ugW0SByW_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2121786409497530450",
      "text": "Collins went for the reverse dunk and got stuffed twice by different players. He's 0-4, having a rough night",
